ive resolution was located in the literature.","status_evidence":[{"title":"BBGKY hierarchy - Wikipedia","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/BBGKY_hierarchy","snippet":"Closing the BBGKY hierarchy requires approximations; common ones include the Boltzmann, Vlasov, and Kirkwood superposition closures, none of which is exact for dense, strongly interacting liquids.","claim":"No exact general closure of the BBGKY hierarchy is known; available closures are approximations valid only in specific regimes."}]},"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"839a6637-3091-4491-932d-056df081e64b"}
